Package: posteriorcpp
Title: Fast C++ Implementations of Bayesian Summary Statistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = c("Andrew", "R."), family = "Johnson", role = c("aut", "cre"),
            email = "andrew.johnson@arjohnsonau.com",
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7000-8065"))
Description: Provides C++/Eigen implementations of summary and
    convergence diagnostics for posterior draws, matching the 'posterior'
    package but optimised for speed. Eigen and pocketfft are bundled, so
    no external headers are required beyond 'Rcpp' and 'RcppParallel'.
